    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπουδ-ί</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span> or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπουδ-εί</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without effort</i> or
				<i>trouble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.512
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				15.476
			</span></i>; <i>without a struggle, ignobly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ μὰν ἀσπουδί γε . . ἀπολοίμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.304
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.9.5
			</span></i>; <i>carelessly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				54.18
			</span></i>.</div>
